test stale_slot_is_returned_as_a_new_token ... peek1() on an empty buffer returned
    Some(Token { token: Ident, joined: Joined, span: Span { start: 0, end: 1 } })
thread '...' panicked at surrealdb/parser/tests/f3_parser_peekable_uninit_ub.rs:181:9:
BUG: peek1() on an empty ring buffer returned a stale/already-consumed token: ...
test result: FAILED. 0 passed; 1 failed; 0 ignored; 4 filtered out

# Miri
error: Undefined Behavior: constructing invalid value of type
  std::result::Result<surrealdb_token::Token, surrealdb_token::LexError>:
  at .<enum-tag>, encountered uninitialized memory, but expected an integer
 --> surrealdb/parser/src/peekable.rs:103:17
